{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S08、S10、S11、S12等短停留段仍安排了较多话句和感受提示，虽然关键词突出、部分感受按音乐出现，但普通观众可能来不及消化，X在这些段落反而更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成更容易扫读的短句，并用加亮关键词让每段真正重要的意思迅速显出来，尤其把人物既怀念亲近、又不愿重新忍受委屈的矛盾讲得更清楚。更重要的是，Y的感受描述与音乐具体时刻对应，能让人感到情绪如何从焦躁转向柔软、从短暂安心重新跌入不安，而不是只看到一串情绪标签。X整体比较利落，但右侧感受词与人物叙事之间的联系不够紧，Y更能让普通观众理解这段经历为什么一步步发展成最后的决定。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec8c3ff3-78bb-4a99-89fa-61a699f60d0c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232320815733Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:24:35.559673+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a27c2dbfe33dd883fba0c894c1c3fbbc71511e31381ed5e11646f7c298366c61", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb